、答えよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分からんのです笑\nごめちょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(流行らそっ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q1期生の推しメンは？\n2期生の推しメンは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あら聞いちゃう？ψ(｀∇´)ψ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1期生では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華さん\n川村真洋さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"矢田里沙子\n堀未央奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村真洋さんはプリンシパルの時\n最初に話してくれた方です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しいのにわざわざ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「大変やけどがんばろーな。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と握手をしてくれました\n感動|(￣3￣)|感動|(￣3￣)|"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして「みり愛ちゃーん」とよんでくれたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華さんは焼肉に行った時\n優しくしてくれて☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも大好きです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りしゃこは本当に大好き♡\n癒し♡いえいψ(｀∇´)ψ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウスのペアなんだけど\n思わずニヤケルのは内緒。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q2期生にイタズラしたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イタズラと言うか、\nいじる事はよくありまっせよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"み「やぁ同い年！」\nき「うるさーい(￣▽￣)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってバカにし合ってます笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q乃木坂の衣装何が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・おいでシャンプー\n・走れbicycleの制服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！可愛い♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっしゃー今回はここまで！\n多すぎてかけませーん(T ^ T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでみなさんが知りたいかなと\n思いそうなものを選抜しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回書きますでお楽しみに......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会間近じゃぁないですかっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くみなさんに会いたいぞぇ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでーなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へっ。へっ。\n楽しみすぎてにやけてしまう(｡-_-｡)\nおお。抑えなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見られちゃう笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来られない方に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしょ？？？\n触角つくったんだー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(すみません。スッピンです。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lessonで忙しい毎日。\nだけどもだっけーど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもわちゃわちゃしてる笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらっ。またななつんブログに\n私が載ってる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばななつんと私の\nコンビ名を考えてくれた方が..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決まりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The ななみりあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どぉーだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとねー。ねー。\nおむつの事、みなさん\nバカにしすぎです笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おむつなんて失礼しちゃうよねー。\n去年で卒業したもんねー。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーっとね、なんかおかしいんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年は小学生だしね、うん。\n確かにはいてたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってちがーーーーう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1、2歳で卒業したもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なめんなよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/07/25/3222862/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.gi